## Handoff

Only mark done when acceptance evidence exists. Record detailed evidence once and
link it under the task. Update current state for changed present facts. Mark replaced
decisions superseded; preserve unique historical proof. For partial work, record the
exact resume action, changed/uncommitted files, failed/unrun checks, blockers and
external residue under the active task. An optional progress file is a short
historical index, never a second status dashboard.

Before temporary deployments/live-data changes, checkpoint the current version,
restoration source, temporary changes/data IDs, missing proof, next action and cleanup
in the task's evidence record. Update identifiers immediately as they become known;
chat history and in-memory state both disappear at an interruption.
